@startuml
title POST /api/v1/games
hide footbox
actor Client
participant "FastAPI / Pydantic" as API
participant "SQLAlchemy session" as DB
database PostgreSQL as PG
Client -> API: POST /api/v1/games
API -> API: Validate path, query and body
note over API: Invalid input -> 422
API -> DB: get_db(): request transaction
ref over API, DB: Clerk identity and route permissions (auth.puml)
DB -> PG: Find pod; missing -> 404
DB -> PG: Insert game; flush generated ID
DB -> PG: For each player: lock member FOR SHARE; require same pod (422)
DB -> PG: Insert players; flush (duplicates -> 409)
DB -> PG: Load game players and nullable result
PG --> DB: Rows / mutation outcome
DB --> API: Route result
API -> API: Validate/serialize response
API -> DB: Finish successful request
DB -> PG: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201
@enduml
